          "text": "Primary: Community-acquired pneumonia (CAP), CURB-65 score 3.\n\nBackground:\n- COPD\n- Atrial fibrillation (AF), on apixaban\n- Hypertension (HTN)",
          "unverified_fact_ids": []
        },
