            "key_investigations.3",
            "key_investigations.4"
          ],
          "text": "On examination at admission: temperature 38.6, respiratory rate 26, oxygen saturations 89% on room air, coarse crackles at right base.\n\nChest X-ray: right lower lobe consolidation.\n\nCRP 180. White cell count 16.\n\nAt discharge (Day 5): oxygen saturations 93% on room air.",
