          "text": "IV co-amoxiclav and IV clarithromycin commenced on admission. Controlled oxygen therapy and IV fluids administered.\n\nITU review on Day 2; ceiling of care agreed as ward-based given COPD severity and frailty.\n\nSwitched to oral antibiotics on Day 3 (10/05).",
